1
00:00:00,192 --> 00:00:02,652
(Penny:)You either help me
throw Leonard a birthday party...

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:04,490
...or I will go into your bedroom...

3
00:00:04,655 --> 00:00:07,195
...and unbag all
your mint-condition comic books.

4
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:11,996
(Penny:)And on one of them... You won't know
which... I'll draw a tiny happy face in ink.

5
00:00:13,748 --> 00:00:17,878
(Sheldon:)You can't do that. If you make a mark
in a mint comic book, it's no longer mint.

6
00:00:18,044 --> 00:00:20,254
(Penny:)Do you understand
the concept of blackmail?

7
00:00:20,421 --> 00:00:22,251
Well, of course, I... Oh.

8
00:00:24,508 --> 00:00:27,888
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I have an idea. Let's throw Leonard
a kickass birthday party.

9
00:00:47,615 --> 00:00:49,365
(Sheldon:)That's not the secret knock.

10
00:00:50,701 --> 00:00:53,041
This is the secret knock:

11
00:00:56,457 --> 00:00:57,957
(Howard:)What difference does it make?

12
00:00:58,125 --> 00:01:01,125
The point of a secret knock
is to establish a nonverbal signal...

